    },
    {
      "claim": "L5 P-gp/BCRP substrate and intestinal-metabolism records for simvastatin, lovastatin, irinotecan, and other molecules (C164, C167, C176, C189, C195, C196, C180, C193) are molecule-specific and do not establish efflux or gut-wall metabolism for the query; no query-specific presystemic-loss measurement exists.",
